# hn_chase_barks (kenshi-jtnm, ksim k16.9.25 / k16.9.26): a Holy Nation patrol (a Holy Paladin leading four Holy servants: squad template 1532649, the
# "Holy Army Patrol" the 1js4 walk meets) hostile to the Wanderer and chasing him over open desert. The speech bubbles it prints are the check: one
# conversation per speaker squad at a time, no line repeated inside its record's repeat delay (DIALOGUE_SELECTION_LIVE Q3 / Q4).
